---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: "Pest Control Services | Zero Pest Control"
description: "Explore all residential and commercial pest control services from Zero Pest Control, serving Sudbury, Espanola, Elliot Lake, Blind River, Manitoulin, and Sault Ste. Marie."
permalink: /services/
---
{% from "partials/icons.njk" import icon %}

<section class="page-hero">
  <div class="container">
    <p class="breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a> / Services</p>
    <h1>Pest Control Services</h1>
    <p class="lede">Targeted treatment for every common Northern Ontario pest — backed by clear pricing, a written quote, and follow-up support.</p>
    <div class="page-hero-ctas">
      <a class="btn btn--primary" href="/contact/">Get a Free Quote</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="grid grid--3">
      {% for item in collections.services %}
      <a class="card service-card reveal" href="{{ item.url }}">
        <div class="icon-badge">{{ icon(item.data.pestIcon or "bug") }}</div>
        <h3>{{ item.data.cardTitle or item.data.pestName or item.data.title }}</h3>
        <p>{{ item.data.tagline }}</p>
        <span class="card-link">Learn More {{ icon("arrow-right") }}</span>
      </a>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section--soft">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="cta-banner reveal">
      <div>
        <h2>Not Sure Which Service You Need?</h2>
        <p>Tell us what you're seeing and where — we'll help identify the pest and recommend the right treatment.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="cta-banner-actions">
        <a class="btn btn--primary" href="/contact/">Get a Free Quote</a>
        <a class="btn btn--outline-invert" href="tel:{{ site.phoneHref }}">{{ icon("phone") }} Call {{ site.phone }}</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
